            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[New: Tikana learns the folders you already keep and suggests a home among them. Places are gone: it may suggest anywhere you keep files.
New: A Rules page shows every rule it has learned. Set one to Always, Ask or Off.
New: Tikana updates itself while you are not using it, and says so on its card.
Fixed: Undoing a move sets its rule back to asking, and a download still being written is left alone.
]]></description>
